  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children&#x2019;s rights - Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Focus on the monitoring of child rights including improving state capacity to monitor and report to the UN Committe on the Rights of the Child; strengthening of national systems and building awareness and capacity of civil society to promote and defend child rights. Other partners: Mahbere Hiwot for Social Development (MHSD), Ministry of Women and Children Affairs (MoWCA), Ethiopian Human Rights Commision, Busca Hamer Integrated Community Development Action/BHICDA</narrative>
  </description>
